서낭나무 — an original exorcist short (Chinese Ink Wash style, made with the Lemo-Opuscar style library)

Story and characters
- Original story, characters and dialogue. The mood of Korean occult fiction is the inspiration; no characters, events or
  settings from any existing work are used. The 서낭나무, the shaman's bells, 작두 and the 아귀 are general Korean folk and
  Buddhist motifs; no real shrine, shaman, ritual text (무가) or company is depicted or quoted.

Picture
- All imagery is generated by code in this folder (Canvas 2D ink strokes and washes on layers, a WebGL rice-paper compositor).
  No photos, no image generation. The brush and compositor engine (ink.js, comp.js) and the figure rig (figure.js, adapted from
  hero.js) come from the library's Chinese Ink Wash demo, Lemo-Opuscar (MIT for code). On screen everything is in Korean;
  the title and seals are Korean.

Music and sound
- Original score composed and synthesized in music/score.py: numpy synthesis (대금-like flute with a buzzing membrane, 장구,
  큰북, 징, 꽹과리, 방울, a low drone) and the library's physically modelled guqin (core/audio/pluck.py) played low as a
  거문고-like string. No samples, no recordings.
- Sound effects and ambience synthesized in mix.py with the library's core/audio/sfx.py and numpy. No recordings.

Voices
- Google Cloud Text-to-Speech, Chirp 3: HD — ko-KR-Chirp3-HD-Kore (서하; also the god's line, doubled in mix.py by a
  lower phase-vocoder copy of the same take), ko-KR-Chirp3-HD-Orus (현장소장), under the user's Google Cloud account and its terms.
- Fish Audio community voice model (free model s2.1-pro-free), under the user's Fish Audio account and its terms:
  "70대 노스님" (a36c3dd96a79431f87072de815559e97) for 무진.
- Speech check: faster-whisper small (MIT) via the library's core/tts/asr_check.py.

